[00:33.76] Sitting up late at night
[00:36.04] I tiptoe through the darkness
[00:38.96] Cold as Hell, black as spades
[00:41.01] Aware of my immediate surroundings
[00:43.96] In my place, I escape
[00:46.08] Up into my hideout
[00:48.66] Hiding from everyone
[00:50.95] My friends all say "Dave, you're mental anyway" (Hey!)
[00:53.93] Drift into a deeper state
[00:56.24] I stalk the cobwebbed stairways
[00:59.00] Dirt grits beneath my feet
